{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026FjAj5ZTiVI1794307219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>第七屆香港中美論壇，周日起一連三日舉行。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.CHINA-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026v0bqVik4St1794307234.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>論壇由中美交流基金會舉辦，三天議程包括閉門討論和公開論壇，將會有約30名來自內地、泰國、美國和新加坡的外交、政商界和學術代表出席，探討中美未來關係，包括地緣政治、經濟貿易，以及人工智能(AI)對青少年安全的影響。</p><p></p><p>同時會探討APEC領導人會議舉行後，香港在政策和經濟上的機遇。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.024724+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T10:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:50:05.411808+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:34:00.731087+00:00","content_hash":"0e4bbbcc994e1f633bc5b7e8b2f6727d6508eba3ec21b46f3e8bc98b93a7c547","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:40:36.024724+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}